## Professional sports teams in Texas

### MLB

- Arlington (Texas) Rangers
- Houston Astros

### NBA

- Dallas Mavericks
- Houston Rockets
- San Antonio Spurs

### NFL

- Dallas Cowboys
- Houston Texans

### NHL

- Dallas Stars
</template>
